      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    bond_price = 950.0\n    cash_flows = [50.0, 50.0, 1050.0]\n    spot_rates = [0.015, 0.018, 0.020]\n    periods = [1, 2, 3]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    from scipy.optimize import fsolve\n\n    def pv_difference(z_spread):\n        present_value = sum(\n            cash_flow / ((1 + (spot_rate + z_spread) / 2) ** (2 * period))\n            for cash_flow, spot_rate, period\n            in zip(cash_flows, spot_rates, periods)\n        )\n        return present_value - bond_price\n\n    z_spread = fsolve(pv_difference, 0.0)[0]\n    answer = round(z_spread * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
